        "official_en_sha256": "c719e2c7f5f2009765c51427b160b98b23a8ea9c0af7a8a2738d19cfd89995c2"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あのパーツにはなんの問題もなかった。\r\nリドの両親が亡くなったのは\r\n空で魔物に襲われたからだと思う。",
        "official_en": "There were actually no issues with that component. I think Lid’s parents were attacked by a monster in the skies, and that’s why they crashed.",
        "real_en": "There was nothing wrong with that part. I think Lid's parents died because a monster attacked them in the sky."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
