        "jp": "これは初代シドの言葉だけど、\r\nリドちゃんの両親もよく言ってたのさ。",
        "official_en": "Those were the words of the first Cid, and your parents were fond of saying that too, Lid.",
        "real_en": "Those were the words of the first Cid,\r\nbut Lid-chan's parents used to say them too."
